  "identifier": "rdkit",
  "name": "RDKit",
  "description": "Open-source cheminformatics toolkit for molecule manipulation, descriptor calculation, substructure searching, and pharmacophore analysis. The standard library for chemical informatics in Python and C++. Used in drug discovery, pharmaceutical AI, ADMET prediction, and molecular machine learning pipelines.",
