  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The de-facto standard for cheminformatics in Python. 3,400+ stars, BSD-3-Clause, conda/pip installable, quarterly releases. Used as a core dependency by virtually every drug discovery AI platform — DeepChem, REINVENT, TorchDrug, and most ADMET prediction tools depend on it. No credible open-source alternative matches its breadth. Essential for any team working on pharmaceutical AI, molecular property prediction, or computational drug design.",
